    "innovation": "Using satellite observations, this paper demonstrates that mesoscale (10-40 km) soil moisture heterogeneity, specifically strong gradients between wet and dry land, doubles the probability of convective storm initiation in the Sahel, revealing a critical land-atmosphere feedback not resolved by climate models.",
